<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING GERMAN FIRST DIVISION GOALSCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Bundesliga after Sunday's game:</p>
<p>11 - Sean Dundee (Karlsruhe).</p>
<p>10 - Fredi Bobic (VfB Stuttgart), Giovane Elber (VfB Stuttgart).</p>
<p>9 - Andreas Herzog (Werder Bremen), Ulf Kirsten (Bayer Leverkusen), Paulo Sergio (Bayer Leverkusen).</p>
